            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "Oh okay. Very near. Haha. All is well. Still in bed… I’ll wait my niece to wake up then I’m good to go. Haha. Reading your bio… it’s just so good. Haha",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "You must be a morning person! I can barely function before my second cup of coffee. 😜",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "Hahaha. Not so early though.. Early for me is like 4am. Hahaha. Depends also if I sleep early at night.. I can be an energizer for you. Haha",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "I can see why you're a morning person! You seem so put-together even when you're just waking up. 😜. You know, you have this natural charm that just draws people in. It's like you're a magnet for positivity. 😜. I’m always up for a little morning energy boost. What’s your favorite way to start the day? 😉",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "Hahaha. I can be… especially if I had a good night sleep… no snoring beside me. Hahaha. Do I? You do toooooo!!!. To start the day… I wanna smooochy smooochy kiss my niece. I like kissing cute kid’s cheeks.. I do pray first in the morning.. Clean.. Then I work out.. You?",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "I usually start my day with a quick jog and some coffee. It helps me clear my head and set a positive tone for the rest of the day.. I love the sound of your morning routine! Kissing your niece's cheeks sounds so sweet. What are your plans for the day, Krisan? 😏",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "Nice… I like that you like to work out. Haha. Yeah… I’ve been doing it for years till she pushed me away. Hahaha. Nothing much really.. I’m still looking for a new work.. You?",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "You're looking for a new job? That's great! Hope you find something that makes you happy and fulfilled. 🤞",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "I definitely will… appreciate that!!! Hihi. What do you do?",
                "date": "2025-08-05"
            },
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "I'm a software engineer, but I'm always looking to learn new skills. How about you? What kind of work are you interested in? 😉",
                "date": "2025-08-06"
            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "I have my degree in Hotel Management.. I used to work for a BPO company.. Now I’m exploring which company to work for.. You have great career btw.",
                "date": "2025-08-06"
            },
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "I can imagine you'd be a natural in a role that involves a lot of interaction and making people feel welcome, like hospitality or customer service. You've got that warm, welcoming energy that puts people at ease. 🌟",
                "date": "2025-08-06"
            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "I love that you put effort on making me feel great. Haha. I’m very much hospitable.. I can give you a warm welcome here also. Hahaha",
                "date": "2025-08-06"
            },
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "I can see why people would love having you around! You've got that special something that makes everyone feel welcome and appreciated.",
                "date": "2025-08-06"
            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "Would you love me to be around you? Haha",
                "date": "2025-08-06"
            },
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "Of course! Your energy is contagious, and I think you'd make everyone around you happy and feel like they're home. So yeah, I'd love you to be around! 😊",
                "date": "2025-08-07"
            },
            {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "Hihi. You’re too kind. But yes… I’m quite like that. Haha. Still here?",
